00:00:34.401 --> 00:00:35.301
This would go from the time

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:38.605
he was a teenager all the way until now.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.373
Tell me more about what

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:42.175
