00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:02.862
feeling like he's

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.030
detached, from the world.

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.098
And as you mentioned, that

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.866
when he hugs his own family,

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.369
he sees nothing.

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:11.938
He also describes looking at his life

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.073
and going through the motions

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.207
