00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.260
And it's it's this is all back

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.062
when he's in about high school in

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.497
his later teen years.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:39.933
And what we know about

00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.102
his life after that is that he ends up

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:42.902
becoming

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:43.903
addicted to heroin

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.472
around the time that he graduated

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:46.873
high school in 2013.

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:50.009
And he's in and out of rehab.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.411
But then what's kind of interesting is

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:53.213
is after that it seems like his life

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.314
